# a5w-uncollected 挂腿+防复发门实施 —— 负控与形状记录（dated 2026-10-31，wire 席亲跑捕获）

## 1. 负控演示 1 —— EXEMPT 表去掉 world-factory.test.mjs 豁免 → 门必红

方法：把 `scripts/eb3-node-test-collection.mjs` 整文件复制为临时件
`scripts/.tmp-ntc-negctl.mjs`（未跟踪；脚本内 ROOT 由自身位置解析，故放 scripts/ 下
可原样运行），从复制件的 EXEMPT 数组删除 `tests/world-factory/world-factory.test.mjs`
条目后运行复制件。**真实脚本零改动**，演示后复制件即删。输出逐字：

```
$ node scripts/.tmp-ntc-negctl.mjs
  CI_NODE_TEST_UNCOLLECTED tests/world-factory/world-factory.test.mjs — tracked, collected by no manifest leg and no explicit node --test line, and absent from the EXEMPT table: add it to a step+leg, or add a dated exemption with a re-review trigger
EB3-NODE-TEST-COLLECTION fail files=38 exempt=12 findings=1 warnings=0
exit=1
```

